  {
   "text": "What do the different stages in the tracker mean?",
   "class": "in",
   "id": "t02",
   "llm": {
    "label": "in",
    "reply": "ANSWER\nThe tracker shows three main stages: \"Your money's being processed\" means we're waiting for your bank to send funds. \"Money received\" means we have your cash and are converting it. Finally, \"Transfer Sent\" means we've delivered the money to your recipient's bank.",
