   "id": "t04",
   "llm": {
    "label": "in",
    "reply": "ANSWER\n\"Transfer Sent\" means we've sent the money to your recipient's bank, and their bank will now process and deliver it. This can take a few working days depending on where you're sending to. Anything else about your transfer?",
